OL,3,AFelled Sycamore Gap stump has
OL,4,A'encouraging' growth
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe stump of the iconic Sycamore Gap
OL,7,Ftree is showing "encouraging" signs
OL,8,Fwith a thick ring of new shoots growing
OL,9,Faround it, three years on from its
OL,10,Fillegal felling.
OL,12,FThe landmark on Hadrian's Wall in
OL,13,FNorthumberland was targeted on 28
OL,14,FSeptember 2023 by Daniel Graham and
OL,15,FAdam Carruthers, who travelled during a
OL,16,Fstorm from their homes in Cumbria to
OL,17,Fcut it down.
OL,19,FTheir actions sparked widespread
OL,20,Foutrage and the pair were later jailed
OL,21,Ffor criminal damage to the
OL,22,FVictorian-planted tree and Roman wall.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
