OL,3,AFelled Sycamore Gap stump has
OL,4,A'encouraging' growth
OL,5,
OL,6,FSite owners the National Trust fenced
OL,7,Foff the stump to see if it would
OL,8,Frecover, with general manager Andrew
OL,9,FPoad saying he is "filled with hope by
OL,10,Fthe way nature is taking its course".
